\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Promotion Recommendation \'97 Role and Impact\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Since joining the organization, Krishna has transformed the Markets GenAI capability from a siloed, use-case-driven model into a scalable platform-based operating model. At the time he joined, the organization had one GenAI application, realized benefits of fewer than 500 hours, and operated at an early maturity level focused primarily on frontier-model usage and prompt engineering. Krishna established a horizontal delivery model in which data scientists and engineers can contribute across products, led the development of the EDGE platform, and created a repeatable approach for onboarding applications. Over the past year, the team has onboarded more than five applications, reduced typical onboarding time to four to six weeks, and delivered more than 2,000 hours in realized productivity benefits.\
Under Krishna\'92s leadership, the team\'92s GenAI and data science maturity has advanced from Level 1 to Level 4 within the organization\'92s maturity framework. The team has progressed beyond prompt-based solutions to capabilities including retrieval-augmented generation, global context, agentic workflows, conversational AI with tools, clustering of unstructured data, and fine-tuned small language models. Krishna has also established an operating culture that balances approximately 80% delivery with 20% discovery and research. This approach has enabled the team to meet near-term business commitments while continuing to develop differentiated capabilities, including an ADK-based agentic platform and the deployment of the firm\'92s first fine-tuned small language model into production.\
Krishna leads from the front and combines strategic leadership with strong hands-on expertise in data science, GenAI, platform architecture, product management, and production delivery. He is consistently called upon to provide direction on complex initiatives, resolve technical and delivery challenges, and partner across Markets Operations Technology and other organizations. He is highly respected by peers and stakeholders and provides thought leadership through the Markets GenAI Champions Forum, where he shares research, practical insights, and guidance on responsible AI and model risk management.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

